{"id":"ofkr77dnqeyu4rt8j7kr5zzi2","title":"我给智能助手一个湖屋和花园控制权","originalTitle":"I gave an agent a lakehouse and control of my garden","summary":"作者在家中开辟了一小块菜园，并通过智能助手管理灌溉、土壤湿度等数据，构建了一个全面监测的菜园系统。最终，作者意识到需要一个湖屋（湖屋盒）来集中存储和管理这些数据，以便智能助手更好地进行决策。整个系统花费约300欧元，但有可能产出价值40欧元的蔬菜。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://jatorre.github.io/garden/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T17:19:06.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T06:42:31.751Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T17:19:06.000Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","技术方案","GitHub"],"score":46,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}